{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600070","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1260007001:0":{"text":"击倒了怪物后，它们果然如前一般，开始迅速褪去扭曲的外表，化为人形。","source_cn":"击倒了怪物后，它们果然如前一般，开始迅速褪去扭曲的外表...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C6D926B4546D3E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1260007002:0":{"text":"只是，这次的受害者，格外生龙活虎。","source_cn":"只是，这次的受害者，格外生龙活虎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8036139057F60531","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1260007003:1":{"text":"呜嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷——","source_cn":"呜嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18DAD8151605CDFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1260007004:1":{"text":"嗷——呃、呃啊？怎么回事？我刚刚怎么突然就……","source_cn":"嗷——呃、呃啊？怎么回事？我刚刚怎么突然就……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99F587C06E83BEA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1260007005:1":{"text":"哇，竟、竟然真的变回来了……","source_cn":"哇，竟、竟然真的变回来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x439E72A328647888","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1260007006:1